From a9b3898fdcd144d191ca7549fcdca0e89a29a0f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 02:31:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 47/56] Party Exp. Share option

Modern Exp. Share: every Pokemon that battled gets the full Exp., the
rest of the team half (each still scaled by its own level, and capped).
Off by default; switch it on in the challenge menu or with the Viridian
City scientist, who now asks LEVEL CAPS / EXP. SHARE. exp_budget.py
gains --party-share to model it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
